&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://111qqz.com/2026/08/gpu-memory-mental-model/" &gt;上一篇&lt;/a&gt;讨论了模型调度中的 Capacity Constraint：一组模型到底能不能同时放进一张 GPU。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>从 CS336 到 ML Infra：理解 Arithmetic Intensity、Accelerator Intensity，以及 Compute Bound / Memory Bound</title><link>https://111qqz.com/2026/09/arithmetic-intensity-compute-bound/</link><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 21:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>hust.111qqz@gmail.com (111qqz)</author><guid>https://111qqz.com/2026/09/arithmetic-intensity-compute-bound/</guid><description>&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;起因
